<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>404 - Página não encontrada | Claudinei</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="https://i.imgur.com/H06lQOz.jpeg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B35 0%, #F7B801 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    
    .container {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 600px;
    }
    
    .error-code {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 15rem);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
    }
    
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      background: white;
      color: #FF6B35;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    
    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    
    .btn.secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: white;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    
    .logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      
      .btn {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/H06lQOz.jpeg" alt="Claudinei Logo" class="logo">
    
    <div class="error-code">404</div>
    
    <h1>Ops! Página não encontrada</h1>
    
    <p>
      Parece que você se perdeu. A página que você está procurando não existe ou foi movida.
      Mas relaxa, a gente te ajuda a voltar pro caminho certo.
    </p>
    
    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="/" class="btn">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
          <path d="M3 10L10 3L17 10M4 9V17C4 17.5523 4.44772 18 5 18H8V14C8 13.4477 8.44772 13 9 13H11C11.5523 13 12 13.4477 12 14V18H15C15.5523 18 16 17.5523 16 17V9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        Voltar para o início
      </a>
      
      <a href="/#waitlist" class="btn secondary">
        Entrar na waitlist
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>